<title>PHILIPPINES: Security Bank stockholders ok stock div.</title>
<headline>Security Bank stockholders ok stock div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security Bank Corp said on Monday its stockholders had approved a 20 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>In an advisory, Security Bank said the dividend was equivalent to 455.26 million worth of shares of the bank's unissued capital stock.</p>
<p>The record date of the stock dividend is yet to be determined, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
